# Model card for granite-geospatial-wxc-downscaling

`granite-geospatial-wxc-downscaling` is a fine-tuned foundation model for the downscaling of weather and climate data. It is based on the Prithvi WxC foundation model.`granite-geospatial-downscaling` has been used to downscale both MERRA-2 data, ECCC data as well as EURO-CORDEX climate simulations. The weights for the former are included here.

